category = "Kettle Cannon"
display_name = "Popcorn Popper"
role = "Full-auto kettle cannon that heats as it fires. Cold, it shoots single kernels; warm, they pop in flight and land in small splash puffs; hot, they fly as big buttered popcorn that bursts wide and slows. Overheat it and the kettle jams for a moment: short bursts keep it hot without jamming, and it stays warm through a reload. The glass dome shows the popcorn left."
